],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "有[BUF02]的[BUF03]。\\p呜呜…\n和、和我组队吧!"
},
{
"addr": "0824444b",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "真、真的吗?\n太棒了!好高兴!呜~呜…\\p啊…抱歉…\n我太兴奋,都哭出来了…\\p我这就去登记,\n别走啊!"
},
{
"addr": "082444ef",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "嗥!我是[BUF04]!\n也就是[BUF02]的第[BUF03]个徒弟!"
},
{
"addr": "08244549",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "和有[BUF02]的[BUF03]。\n很棒是不是?\\p那就来吧!\n我们组队吧!"
},
{
"addr": "0824459b",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "哈!棒极了!\n好了,我去登记,好吗?"
},
{
"addr": "082445c5",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "呋,为什么?\n我想跟你组队啊,[BUF01]!"
},
{
"addr": "082445e8",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "我是[BUF04],伟大的[BUF02]\n的第[BUF03]个徒弟!"
},
{
"addr": "08244643",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "和有[BUF02]的[BUF03]\n就是我带的伙伴。\\p拜托了,\n跟我组队吧!"
},
{
"addr": "0824468f",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "谢谢!\n我这就去登记!"
},
{
"addr": "082446b4",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "[BUF01],我一直希望\n能和你组队…"
},
{
"addr": "082446e5",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "哞…你能花时间来找我\n我真的很高兴。\\p我是[BUF04],\n也就是[BUF02]的第[BUF03]个徒弟…"
},
{
"addr": "0824479e",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "和会[BUF02]的[BUF03]。\n我知道我的要求有点过分…\\p我想你可能不愿意,\n但我真的想成为你的搭档。"
},
{
"addr": "0824480c",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "真的吗?真不敢相信!\n我真的不敢相信你会接纳我!\\l我…我一定不会让你失望的!\\p哞…真的可以的话,\n我这就去登记!"
},
{
"addr": "082448cd",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "嗥,我是[BUF04],\n[BUF02]的第[BUF03]个徒弟!"
},
{
"addr": "08244939",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "和会[BUF02]\n的[BUF03]。\\p不错的队伍,是不?\n想和我组队吗?"
},
{
"addr": "08244989",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "太好了,很荣幸和你组队!\n我希望你不要拖我的后腿!\\l我现在去登记一下。"
},
{
"addr": "08244a23",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "我是[BUF04],一个三项全能运动员。\n我每天都忙着\\l跑步、锻炼,\\p偶然之下成了[BUF02]的\n第[BUF03]个徒弟。"
},
{
"addr": "08244ad6",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "和用[BUF02]\n的[BUF03]。\\p无论我有多忙,我都会\n尽最大的努力去培养他们。\\p让我们组队\n横扫一切对手吧!"
},
{
"addr": "08244b52",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "好极了,要的就是这种精神!\n我去登记,你就在这儿等一下吧。"
},
{
"addr": "08244bd2",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "嗥!\n怎么样?\\p我是[BUF04],[BUF02]的\n第[BUF03]个徒弟。很高兴见到你!"
},
{
"addr": "08244c6e",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "和[BUF02]的[BUF03]。\n当然,我的培养方式也非常完美!\\p好了,组个队如何?\n我相信我们的联手一定超强!"
},
{
"addr": "08244cd6",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "哈,我想这次一定会很有趣的!\n我去登记了!"
},
{
"addr": "08244d36",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "请允许我先介绍一下自己。\n我是[BUF04],\\p也就是[BUF02]的\n第[BUF03]个徒弟。"
},
{
"addr": "08244dfe",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "哇…太高兴了!\n我保证我一定会做到最好!\\p我现在就去登记!\n请稍等!"
},
{
"addr": "08244e5b",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "我一直都想和你组队的,\n[BUF01]…"
},
{
"addr": "08244e7e",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "哇!你和我说话了!\n我…我太高兴了!\\p我是[BUF04]![BUF02]的\n第[BUF03]个徒弟!"
},
{
"addr": "08244ef4",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "和会[BUF02]的\n[BUF03]。\\p拜托,答应我吧,\n我想成为你的搭档!"
},
{
"addr": "08244f4f",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "喑!我…我兴奋地要晕倒了!\n非常感谢!\\l我马上就去登记!"
},
{
"addr": "0824503d",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "和擅长[BUF02]的\n[BUF03]。\\p这组合不错吧?\n你会和我搭档的吧?"
},
{
"addr": "08245087",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "好,太棒了!\n我很快就能登记好!"
},
{
"addr": "082450c0",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "切!\n你真是个斤斤计较的家伙,[BUF01]!"
},
{
"addr": "082450e6",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "嘿!我们有大麻烦了!\n明天对战塔就要关门了!\\p… … … … … …\n只是开个玩笑!\\p人们都叫我[BUF04]!\n[BUF02]的第一千个徒弟!\\l但实际上,我是第[BUF03]个!"
},
{
"addr": "082451bd",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "和会[BUF02]的[BUF03]。\n每种我都有十只!\\l呋,实际上,只是每种一只!\\p如何?\n想和我组队吗?"
},
{
"addr": "0824522f",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "哈哈哈!\n作为感谢,我送你一只宝可梦!\\p当然,是开玩笑的!那么我\n这就去登记,可以吧?"
},
{
"addr": "082453b4",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "[BUF04]给的建议我照做了,\n我为我的队伍感到骄傲!\\l使用[BUF02]的[BUF03]"
},
{
"addr": "08245406",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "和使用[BUF02]的\n[BUF03]!\\p让组队的胜利\n纪念我们的相遇!"
},
{
"addr": "08245464",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "嘿嘿,我喜欢这样的你!\n让我现在就去登记!"
},
{
"addr": "082454a3",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "哦呀,[BUF01],你真绝情!\n或许是我太唐突了!"
},
{
"addr": "082454d6",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "耶耶,呀--呼--!\n喂,别跑呀!我没病,只是自娱自乐!\\p喑哈哈!我是[BUF04]!\n[BUF02]的第[BUF03]个徒弟!"
},
{
"addr": "0824555f",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "使用[BUF02]的[BUF03]\n它们是我的选择。\\p好了你觉得怎么样?\n来吧我们组个队!\\p拜托就算我求你!\n我们一起向前进!"
},
{
"addr": "082455ec",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "呀哈!幸运站在我身边!\n现在的我好高兴!\\p我们开始比赛前,\n还要赶快去登记!"
},
{
"addr": "08245656",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "这么干脆地拒绝我?\n[BUF01]你让我很不爽!"
},
{
"addr": "0824568a",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "咳咳!\\p啊,抱歉,我感冒了。\n但我的宝可梦没事。\\p我的名字是[BUF04],[BUF02]的\n第[BUF03]个徒弟。咳咳!"
},
{
"addr": "08245c05",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "谢谢!\n我这就去登记!"
},
{
"addr": "082ee5f8",
"kinds": [
"aligned"
],
"fmt": {
"kind": "dialogue",
"width": 34,
"lines": 0,
"pages": true
},
"zh": "[BUF02]:嘿,[BUF01]!\n我们正在聊天。\\l想要加入我们吗?"
}
]